<title>THAILAND: General Finance appoints new chairman.</title>
<headline>General Finance appoints new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Finance and Securities Plc announced on Monday that the company had given president Suchartchandra Pravitra the additional post of chairman.</p>
<p>Suchartchandra replaces Narongchai Akrasanee, who has become Thailand's commerce minister in the new government of Prime Minister Chavalit Yongchaiyudh.</p>
<p>Narongchai, a non-elected member of parliament, started his ministerial work on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
